      "explanation": "Main idea: darunter means including or underneath. In lists, darunter often means “among them”.",
      "examples": [
        {
          "de": "Viele Gäste kamen, darunter auch Kinder.",
          "lv": "Many guests came, including some children."
        },
        {
          "de": "Der Schlüssel liegt darunter.",
          "lv": "The key is underneath."
        },
        {
          "de": "Es gibt viele Probleme, darunter die hohen Kosten.",
          "lv": "There are many problems, including the high costs."
        }
      ],
