      "layout": "standardStudy",
      "translation": "Profession",
      "explanation": "Main idea: der Beruf means a person's profession or permanent field of work. It answers the question of what a person does for a living. die Arbeit is work in general or a specific piece of work. der Job is a more informal word for work or a workplace. An occupation in the sense of an activity is not the main meaning of der Beruf at A2 level.",
